        <li><strong>No counterfeit guesswork.</strong> The proof is cryptographic, not a logo.</li>
        <li><strong>Works on resale.</strong> Provenance survives every change of hands.</li>
        <li><strong>Their choice of app.</strong> Any conformant wallet or scanner works.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="benefits-col">
      <h3><span class="benefits-icon">{{ flowIcons.institution | safe }}</span>What the manufacturer experiences</h3>
      <ul class="benefits">
        <li><strong>Counterfeits lose their cover.</strong> Fakes can't produce a valid credential.</li>
